<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 2.1 points off FTSE, Oct 7.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 2.1 points off FTSE, Oct 7.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 index stocks will go ex-dividend on October 7 and analysts estimate the effect will be to take 2.1 points off the index that day.</p>
<p>							    DIVIDEND    INDEX</p>
<p>							    (PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY				 Net   Gross  Gross</p>
<p>* Argos						   5.300  6.625  0.113</p>
<p>* Guinness						4.550  5.688  0.643</p>
<p>* Lasmo						   4.9022 6.128  0.343</p>
<p>* Royal &amp; Sun Alliance				6.500  8.125  0.723</p>
<p>* United News &amp; Media				 8.000 10.000  0.280</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
